1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,440
成年人最扎心的真相是什么
What is the most painful truth of adulthood?

2
00:00:02,440 --> 00:00:05,060
没人会毫不保留的教你
No one will teach you without holding something back.

3
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:08,900
职场里前辈教你三分留你七分
At work, seniors teach you three parts and keep seven back,

4
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:11,080
怕你超越怕你顶替
afraid you will surpass or replace them.

5
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:13,780
行业里老手藏着核心干货
Industry veterans keep the core know-how to themselves.

6
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:15,360
套路永远比真话多
There are always more tactics than honest answers.

7
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:17,740
你花钱报课拜师学艺
You pay for courses or seek a mentor,

8
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:21,360
大部分人也是选择性的教学
but most people still teach selectively.

9
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:24,380
只是教你皮毛不会教你底层
They only teach the surface, not the fundamentals.

10
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:26,760
所有人都怕你变强
Everyone fears you becoming stronger,

11
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:28,780
唯独AI例外
except AI.

12
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:31,660
只有AI是这个世界上唯一
Only AI is the one teacher in this world

13
00:00:31,660 --> 00:00:34,720
毫不保留无限次数不带私心
that holds nothing back, has no limit and no selfish motives,

14
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,160
不收情绪的老师
and takes no emotional toll.

15
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:42,560
今天直接把我经常用的八大AI训练方法
Today I will break down the eight AI training methods I use,

16
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:44,480
全部拆给你
all of them, for you.

17
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:47,620
最后我会把全套的提示词分享给大家
At the end, I will share the complete set of prompts.

18
00:00:47,620 --> 00:00:50,660
第一真实错误模拟器
First: a realistic mistake simulator.

19
00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:53,100
不是直接给正确答案
It does not just give you the right answer.

20
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:55,860
你把你的业务问题丢进去
Give it your business problem.

21
00:00:55,860 --> 00:00:58,220
让AI搭建实战场景
Ask AI to build a realistic scenario

22
00:00:58,220 --> 00:01:00,040
故意设置陷阱
and deliberately set traps.

23
00:01:00,040 --> 00:01:03,160
你做方案写SOP做营销策划
You make plans, write SOPs or plan marketing.

24
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:05,960
做错了AI不直接纠正
If you make a mistake, AI does not correct you directly.

25
00:01:05,960 --> 00:01:09,340
只是不断的引导你自己找漏洞
It keeps guiding you to find the gaps yourself.

26
00:01:09,340 --> 00:01:11,580
最少让你踩两次坑
It lets you fall into at least two traps

27
00:01:11,580 --> 00:01:13,580
再揭晓问题在哪
before revealing where the problem lies.

28
00:01:13,580 --> 00:01:16,960
反复练习直到你独立答对
Practice repeatedly until you get it right on your own.

29
00:01:16,960 --> 00:01:20,320
不是背答案是练判断力
It is not memorizing answers; it is training judgment.

30
00:01:20,980 --> 00:01:22,580
第二困惑破解者
Second: a confusion breaker.

31
00:01:22,580 --> 00:01:24,660
遇到难懂的专业知识点
When you encounter a difficult specialist concept,

32
00:01:24,660 --> 00:01:26,620
不让AI甩专业术语
do not let AI throw jargon at you.

33
00:01:26,620 --> 00:01:31,740
要求AI先用生活类比给一句核心的钥匙句
Ask for a key sentence using an everyday analogy first.

34
00:01:32,260 --> 00:01:35,420
然后抛出三道检验题
Then it gives you three test questions.

35
00:01:35,420 --> 00:01:38,920
必须三道全部答对才能往下选
You must get all three right before choosing what comes next.

36
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:40,600
避免似懂非懂
Avoid only half-understanding.

37
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:42,780
看懂了但不会落地
You may understand what you read but still cannot apply it.

38
00:01:43,260 --> 00:01:45,420
第三定制学习路径
Third: a customized learning path.

39
00:01:45,420 --> 00:01:48,300
给AI输入你的目标现有基础
Give AI your goal and your current foundation,

40
00:01:48,300 --> 00:01:50,080
每周可投入的时间
and how much time you can invest each week.

41
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:52,020
AI输出七天学习计划
AI produces a seven-day learning plan.

42
00:01:52,020 --> 00:01:53,660
每天固定45分钟
Set aside 45 minutes each day.

43
00:01:53,660 --> 00:01:55,180
明确今天要做什么
Make clear what you should do today,

44
00:01:55,180 --> 00:01:57,380
做到什么样才算完成
what counts as completion,

45
00:01:57,380 --> 00:01:58,740
哪里容易踩坑
and where the likely pitfalls are.

46
00:01:58,740 --> 00:02:01,820
一旦跟不上立即动态调整计划
If you cannot keep up, adjust the plan immediately.

47
00:02:01,820 --> 00:02:04,580
不是一套方案硬套所有人
Do not force one plan on everyone.

48
00:02:04,580 --> 00:02:08,220
第四隐藏漏洞检测器
Fourth: a hidden-gap detector.

49
00:02:08,220 --> 00:02:11,360
当你觉得自己已经学会这项技能
When you feel you have learned a skill,

50
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,000
交给AI
give it to AI.

51
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:15,660
AI抛出五个深挖底层的问题
AI asks five probing questions

52
00:02:15,660 --> 00:02:16,940
专门挑那种
targeting blind spots where

53
00:02:16,940 --> 00:02:19,260
看着会一上手就废的盲区
you seem to know it, but cannot apply it.

54
00:02:19,260 --> 00:02:21,360
只要回答浮于表面
If your answer stays on the surface,

55
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:24,100
直接点破你的知识短板
it points out gaps in your knowledge

56
00:02:24,100 --> 00:02:27,280
告诉你哪里只是浅尝辄止
and where you have only scratched the surface.

57
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:30,860
第五严苛进度镜像
Fifth: a strict mirror of your progress.

58
00:02:30,860 --> 00:02:34,320
把你每一次作业方案全部存档
Archive every assignment and plan.

59
00:02:34,320 --> 00:02:38,300
AI对比你前后产出区分
AI compares your earlier and later work to distinguish

60
00:02:38,300 --> 00:02:40,540
是真的能力提升
distinguishing real improvement

61
00:02:40,540 --> 00:02:43,740
还是反复犯同一个老错误
from repeating the same old mistake.

62
00:02:43,740 --> 00:02:45,140
如果停止不前
If you stop moving forward,

63
00:02:45,140 --> 00:02:45,980
直接点名
it points that out.

64
00:02:45,980 --> 00:02:48,760
只夸奖可以量化的进步
It only praises measurable progress,

65
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:50,220
不做虚假鼓励
without false encouragement.

66
00:02:50,220 --> 00:02:53,280
第六最坏情景教练
Sixth: a worst-case scenario coach.

67
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:55,400
模拟高压突发场景
Simulate a high-pressure unexpected situation,

68
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:58,060
不给任何参考资料
without providing any reference material.

69
00:02:58,060 --> 00:03:00,420
比如客户临时改需求
For example, a client changes requirements at the last minute,

70
00:03:00,420 --> 00:03:02,320
方案现场被质疑
or your plan is challenged on the spot.

71
00:03:02,320 --> 00:03:04,540
让你现场输出结束之后
You respond on the spot. Afterwards,

72
00:03:04,540 --> 00:03:06,680
AI复盘你的薄弱环节
AI reviews your weak points

73
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:10,180
告诉你要针对性的哪些地方
and tells you which areas to target.

74
00:03:10,180 --> 00:03:12,020
提前演练风险
Rehearse the risks in advance.

75
00:03:12,020 --> 00:03:16,120
第七思维捷径检查员
Seventh: a mental-shortcut checker.

76
00:03:17,200 --> 00:03:19,380
你解决完一个业务问题
After you solve a business problem,

77
00:03:19,380 --> 00:03:22,540
让AI回溯你的思考全过程
ask AI to trace your entire thinking process.

78
00:03:22,540 --> 00:03:25,720
如果你是靠猜靠模板
If you relied on guessing or templates,

79
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:27,700
死记硬背拿来的结果
or arrived at the result through rote memorization,

80
00:03:27,700 --> 00:03:28,900
直接打回重写
it sends it back for a rewrite.

81
00:03:28,900 --> 00:03:30,260
你必须讲清楚
You must explain clearly

82
00:03:30,260 --> 00:03:32,300
每一步为什么这么判断
why you made each judgment.

83
00:03:32,300 --> 00:03:35,460
逻辑通顺才算真正掌握
Only sound logic counts as real mastery.

84
00:03:35,460 --> 00:03:37,100
杜绝碰运气
No relying on luck.

85
00:03:37,100 --> 00:03:40,380
第八反向教学模拟器
Eighth: a reverse-teaching simulator.

86
00:03:40,380 --> 00:03:43,120
反过来让AI当小白学生
Reverse the roles: let AI be a beginner student,

87
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:45,580
你来当老师讲解知识
and you teach it the knowledge.

88
00:03:45,580 --> 00:03:48,200
你只要一说专业术语
Whenever you use a technical term,

89
00:03:48,200 --> 00:03:49,680
AI立刻追问
AI immediately asks follow-up questions,

90
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:51,900
要案例要通俗解释
asking for examples and plain-language explanations.

91
00:03:51,900 --> 00:03:53,880
如果你逻辑有错误
If your logic is wrong,

92
00:03:53,880 --> 00:03:57,020
AI顺着你的错误推导
AI follows that mistaken reasoning

93
00:03:57,020 --> 00:03:59,360
直到得出荒谬结果
until it reaches an absurd result.

94
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:02,160
帮你发现自己理解的误区
It helps reveal the flaws in your understanding,

95
00:04:02,160 --> 00:04:04,680
直到你能把事情讲明白
until you can explain things clearly.

96
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:09,140
最后呢也是适用所有学习方法的终极大招
Finally, the ultimate method that applies to all learning:

97
00:04:09,140 --> 00:04:13,740
高手呢不会只用单一的一个AI工具
Experts do not use just one AI tool.

98
00:04:13,740 --> 00:04:15,520
同一个业务难题
For the same business problem,

99
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:19,120
你可以多AI分工协作
you can assign different roles to multiple AIs.

100
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:20,420
一号AI呢
AI number one:

101
00:04:20,420 --> 00:04:22,700
错误模拟器制造场景
a mistake simulator that creates scenarios

102
00:04:22,700 --> 00:04:24,940
让你试错踩坑
and lets you try, fail and encounter pitfalls.

103
00:04:24,940 --> 00:04:26,960
二号AI漏洞检测器
AI number two: a gap detector

104
00:04:26,960 --> 00:04:29,180
挑方案里面的问题
that finds problems in the plan.

105
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:30,580
三号AI
AI number three:

106
00:04:30,580 --> 00:04:33,600
交叉校验所有结果
cross-check all the results

107
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:34,820
对比不同思路
and compare different approaches.

108
00:04:34,820 --> 00:04:37,280
多个AI呢相互校验
Multiple AIs cross-check one another,

109
00:04:37,280 --> 00:04:38,540
相互博弈
challenge one another,

110
00:04:38,540 --> 00:04:39,860
层层打磨
and refine the work layer by layer,

111
00:04:39,860 --> 00:04:42,680
最后筛选出来最优答案
finally selecting the best answer.

112
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:45,160
成年人呢最高级的自律
The highest form of adult self-discipline

113
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:47,900
是借助毫无保留的AI
is using AI that holds nothing back

114
00:04:47,900 --> 00:04:50,280
把别人学不会学不透
to take skills others cannot learn or fully understand,

115
00:04:50,280 --> 00:04:52,380
学不全的本事
or cannot learn completely,

116
00:04:52,380 --> 00:04:55,760
练成自己安身立命的硬实力
and turn them into solid skills you can rely on.

117
00:04:56,160 --> 00:05:00,020
你拿到的永远是当下最适合你的最优答案
What you receive is always the best answer for you right now.

118
00:05:00,020 --> 00:05:02,280
完整提示词呢我会放在评论区置顶
I will pin the complete prompts in the comments.

119
00:05:02,860 --> 00:05:05,060
我是超哥在兰州AI创业
I am Chao, building an AI business in Lanzhou.
